NAME
       link - make a hard link (the plain system call, no options)

SYNOPSIS
       link FILE NEWNAME

DESCRIPTION
       link creates NEWNAME as a hard link to FILE: a second name for the
       same data, on the same file system. It does exactly one thing and has
       no options; ln does the same and much more (symbolic links, several
       files, -f).

EXAMPLES
           link /root/report.txt /root/report-copy.txt
           ls -li /root/report*.txt

SEE ALSO
       ln(1), unlink(1)
